{
  "info": {
    "name": "Admin Module E2E Test",
    "description": "管理员模块端到端测试 — 23 个用例,覆盖登录鉴权、RBAC、用户管理、用户分组全链路。\n\n## 前置条件\n1. 启动 Spring Boot 服务(默认 http://localhost:8080)\n2. 数据库里已存在管理员账号 `displayName='rootadmin'`,邮箱和密码通过下方变量 `adminEmail` / `adminPassword` 配置\n3. 数据库已存在至少一个 `is_default=true` 的分组(Default 分组)\n\n## 运行方式\nPostman → Collection Runner → 选中本 collection → 顺序运行全部 23 个请求。\n\n## 响应结构说明(关键!)\n本项目两种响应结构并存:\n- **成功**:Controller 直接返回 DTO,字段扁平在响应根级,例如 `{accessToken, refreshToken, userId, email, role}`\n- **业务错误**:走 GlobalExceptionHandler,包成 `{code, message, data: null}`,例如 `{code: 6002, message: '自我角色修改被拒绝', data: null}`\n\n所有脚本都用 `const data = json.data ?? json` 同时兼容两种结构。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "8a3f5c9e-1b2d-4e7f-9a8c-5d6e7f8a9b0c"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
    {"key": "adminEmail", "value": "rootadmin@jurong.local"},
    {"key": "adminPassword", "value": "Admin123!"},
    {"key": "testPassword", "value": "Test123456"}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 管理员登录",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{adminEmail}}\",\"password\":\"{{adminPassword}}\"}",
          "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
        },
        "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]},
        "description": "管理员登录,获取 token 用于后续 admin 接口"
      },
      "event": [{
        "listen": "test",
        "script": {
          "type": "text/javascript",
          "exec": [
            "const json = pm.response.json();",
            "// 兼容:成功时扁平,业务错误时有 data 包装",
            "const data = json.data !== undefined ? json.data : json;",
            "const code = json.code !== undefined ? json.code : 0;",
            "pm.expect(code).to.eql(0);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.accessToken);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminRefreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminId', data.userId);",
            "console.log('[Step 1] 管理员登录成功,adminId=' + data.userId);"
          ]
        }
      }]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 管理员搜索自己",
